// LLP 1053.000.000 §2 as a page: glass groups on Apple over saturated
// stripes — two glass merging (row 1), apart past the spacing (3), a group
// inside a group (5), paint order (7), a glass isolated by a fading box
// (8) and by a clipping one (10), and a scroll on either side of a group
// (11), and a group whose spacing is its gap (`glassGroup="auto"`, LLP
// 1053.000.000.000: apart at rest, as Apple's spacing-equals-gap pattern
// is). The web and Linux draw each glass alone, as without a group (D1);
// Apple's pictures are compared by eye with §2.
